    "collapsible_tabs_ra989h": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_XWbb8m": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do you ensure quality?",
            "answer": "<p>Loulou Lollipop strives to meet the highest standards for safety and durability.   We are fully hands-on throughout the product development process – materials, design, construction – and back this up with third-party testing to ensure every product meets US & Canadian safety standards.</p><p>Learn more about Loulou Lollipop’s commitment to safety <a href=\"https://louloulollipop.com/pages/safety-1\" title=\"Safety\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_JGPB6G": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are Loulou Lollipop products sustainable?",
            "answer": "<p>We care about people <em>and</em> the planet.  Our core materials – TENCEL™ Lyocell, Silicone, Muslin from Bamboo – were all chosen for their earth-friendly properties.  Further, we work with trusted manufacturing partners that are BSCI certified, ensuring fair wages, safe work conditions, and absolutely no forced or child labor <em>ever.</em></p><p>Find out more about our sustainability journey <a href=\"https://louloulollipop.com/pages/sustainability\" title=\"Sustainability\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_hh7QYX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are your teethers safe?",
            "answer": "<p>Safety is the most important thing to us here at Loulou Lollipop.  All teethers are third-party tested for ASTM & CSPIA safety compliance.  All accessories are non-toxic and free of BPA, PVC, phthalates, lead, and cadmium. </p><p><em>Read more about our commitment to safety </em><a href=\"https://louloulollipop.com/pages/safety\" title=\"Safety\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>here</em></span></a><em>.</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_bgnGeA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How are your apparel items different than other brands?",
            "answer": "<p>We use our signature soft & sustainable TENCEL™ & organic cotton jersey blend for all apparel items, including baby and kid’s sleepers & pajamas, as well as our 2.5 TOG sleep bags.  TENCEL™ Lyocell has superior thermal regulating properties providing ultimate comfort for babies with sensitive skin and eczema.</p><p>Our fabric is also OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified – see all of our certifications <a href=\"https://louloulollipop.com/pages/safety\" title=\"Safety\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_X8QJJr": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know what apparel size to purchase?",
            "answer": "<p>Our baby & kids clothes fit true to size, but all children are different. Our size charts are a great way to estimate the best size for your little one.</p><p>Size charts can be found on our product pages.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_WcfGgQ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How should I care for my new Loulou Lollipop items?",
            "answer": "<p>Being a mom is tough!  We try to ensure all of our products are made-to-last and easy to care for.  For product-specific details, please refer to the “care” section on the product page.</p><h5><strong>General Care:</strong></h5><p><strong>Soft Goods</strong> – apparel and muslin items should be washed on gentle cycle, tumble dry low or air dry for best results. We recommend washing muslin items in a delicates garment bag.</p><p><strong>Tableware</strong>  – all silicone feeding items are dishwasher safe, silicone bibs and placemats should be placed on the top rack only</p><p><strong>Teethers & Pacifier Clips</strong> – these items are naturally antimicrobial and should not be sterilized, we recommend simply washing with warm, soapy water!</p><p>*<em>For any wooden items, please do not submerge in water – use a damp cloth and mild dish soap to clean.If your wooden accessories dull over time, you can rub on a 50/50 mixture of organic beeswax, and olive oil or coconut oil over the surface.  Simply wipe the mixture on the wooden accessory and let sit for a couple hours allowing it time to soak into the wood, wipe off any excess</em></p>"
          }
        },
        "question_KJjeRx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do your products come with a warranty?",
            "answer": "<p>We take pride in the quality of our products and offer a 3-month warranty from the purchase date in the event an item is found to be defective.  Our warranty applies only to manufacturers defects and <strong>does not</strong> cover normal wear and tear or improper use.  Please follow the cleaning and care instructions located on the product packaging or care tag(s) to ensure the longevity of your items. Pacifier clips <strong>cannot</strong> be sterilized.</p><p>If you believe you’ve received a defective item, please <a href=\"https://louloulollipop.com/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact Us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> so we can help replace your item.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
